      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your reaction is a natural form of philosophical dread, and the vastness of the universe does make our struggles feel insignificantly small. However, realizing our tiny scale also highlights how beautifully you actually experience the universe, finding magic in individual moments that remain unique to you. While the void feels empty, your tears show that you still feel deeply enough to process it, which is the very strength needed to get through your day.",
