    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why do we have to keep fighting for a \"story\" that ends in absolute nothingness? it feels like we're just being forced to struggle and suffer for no reason. if everything is just going to be erased and become part of the silence eventually, then why is it so wrong to just... stop? why is it considered \"wrong\" to want to reach that silence sooner if the struggle is just as meaningless as the end?",
